sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 사용자
    participant UI as Next.js UI
    participant API as K8sController
    participant K8S as K8sService
    participant KCF as KubernetesClientFactory
    participant STM as SshTunnelManager
    participant KC as KubernetesClient
    participant K8sAPI as k3s API Server

    User->>UI: 매니페스트 YAML 입력 후 Apply 클릭
    UI->>API: POST /api/clusters/{name}/k8s/apply<br/>{ yaml: "..." }
    API->>K8S: applyManifest(clusterName, yaml)

    K8S->>KCF: getClient(clusterName)
    KCF->>KCF: clusterRepository.findByName()
    alt 원격 클러스터 (serverId != null)
        KCF->>STM: getOrCreateTunnel(cluster)
        STM->>STM: SSH 터널 생성 (로컬포트 → k3s API 6443)
        STM-->>KCF: localPort
        KCF->>KC: KubernetesClientBuilder(tunneled kubeconfig)
    else 로컬 클러스터
        KCF->>KC: KubernetesClientBuilder(local kubeconfig)
    end
    KCF-->>K8S: KubernetesClient

    K8S->>K8S: YAML 파싱 (multi-doc 지원)
    loop 각 리소스별
        K8S->>KC: serverSideApply(resource)
        KC->>K8sAPI: PATCH /apis/.../apply
        K8sAPI-->>KC: 결과
        KC-->>K8S: 완료
    end

    K8S->>K8S: ApplyHistory(action=apply, result=success) 저장
    K8S-->>API: ApplyHistory
    API-->>UI: { result: "success" }
    UI-->>User: Apply 완료 토스트

    Note over UI,K8sAPI: Delete 흐름도 동일 (action=delete)

    User->>UI: 리소스 목록 조회 (Pods 탭)
    UI->>API: GET /api/clusters/{name}/k8s/pods?namespace=ai-system
    API->>K8S: getPods(clusterName, "ai-system")
    K8S->>KCF: getClient(clusterName)
    KCF-->>K8S: KubernetesClient
    K8S->>KC: pods().inNamespace("ai-system").list()
    KC->>K8sAPI: GET /api/v1/namespaces/ai-system/pods
    K8sAPI-->>KC: PodList
    KC-->>K8S: List~Pod~
    K8S->>K8S: toPodResponse() 변환
    K8S-->>API: List~K8sPodResponse~
    API-->>UI: JSON 응답
    UI-->>User: Pod 목록 테이블 렌더
